/media/images/dw/20230116/691699959573516288984560.jpeg/VYksnHor6Ca_mu7DI2Z9fbQDEPLmFDWp4A7GdeAOxnU\"/><figcaption>對抗壓力3部曲（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"對抗壓力3部曲（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230116/691699962287362048237109.jpeg/NWkG4Wz4u88uVsjscSiehC46deEhmApVrEP5_KxD-fw\"/><figcaption>對抗壓力3部曲（01製圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T15:39:43.647105+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1793,"images":30,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}